adaptation = "The formula is evaluated in the source-supported fq=None mode so OHLC and VWAP remain in the same unadjusted price units. The signal uses information through the T-day close and is evaluated against the standard T+1 open return. Normalization audit: Only case and whitespace were normalized. JoinQuant publishes the recurrence but not its server-side seed; the implementation uses the first valid observation as the seed and suppresses the first 120 input observations."
